    summary: "Iranian ambassador summoned over alleged cyberattacks on French supermarket fridges French Foreign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot said on Monday that Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps was responsible for the cyberattacks on the refrigeration systems of French supermarkets that took place last month. France summoned the Iranian ambassador to the foreign ministry over the attacks. Barrot said that Iran would face consequences, which could include further EU sanctions.",
    preview: "Iranian ambassador summoned over alleged cyberattacks on French supermarket fridges French Foreign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot said on Monday that Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps was responsible for the cyberattacks on the refrigeration systems of French supermarkets that took place last month. France summoned the Iranian ambassador to the foreign ministry over the attacks. Barrot said that Iran would face consequences, which could include further EU sanctions.",
    body: "Iranian ambassador summoned over alleged cyberattacks on French supermarket fridges French Foreign Minister Jean-Noel Barrot said on Monday that Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps was responsible for the cyberattacks on the refrigeration systems of French supermarkets that took place last month. France summoned the Iranian ambassador to the foreign ministry over the attacks. Barrot said that Iran would face consequences, which could include further EU sanctions.",
